1
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:44,200
I am exhausted. My new exercise class is so hard.

2
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,150
Your new exercise class?

3
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:55,720
Yeah. My new advanced exercise class.

4
00:00:55,720 --> 00:01:00,820
Why advanced?

5
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:01,700
My instructor thought that

6
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:06,050
the beginner's class was too easy for me.

7
00:01:06,050 --> 00:01:08,730
Too easy for you?

8
00:01:08,730 --> 00:01:13,050
Don't laugh. In the beginner's class,

9
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:15,860
they give you a chance to rest between exercises.

10
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,140
So?

11
00:01:17,140 --> 00:01:21,180
The advanced class is nonstop.

12
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:23,820
I lift weights every morning for sixty minutes

13
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:25,630
without stopping.

14
00:01:25,630 --> 00:01:29,210
No problem.

15
00:01:29,210 --> 00:01:31,240
Listen, Richard,

16
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:35,140
doing aerobics for an hour is a lot different than lifting weights.

17
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,180
Yeah. Quite a bit different.

18
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:39,400
I think aerobics is easy.

19
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:44,510
I could work out in your class with no problem.

20
00:01:44,510 --> 00:01:45,730
You think so?

21
00:01:45,730 --> 00:01:48,600
Oh, without a doubt.

22
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,860
When's the next class?

23
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:57,260
Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock. Try it.

24
00:01:57,260 --> 00:01:59,790
Tomorrow morning after lifting weights,

25
00:01:59,790 --> 00:02:01,640
I'll try aerobics.

26
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:20,360
It's a nap. Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock.

27
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:23,210
Aren't you going to the aerobics class this morning?

28
00:02:23,210 --> 00:02:32,590
Of Course. Easy. No sweat.

29
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:34,720
You are not going to be able to move

30
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,890
after this and the aerobics class.

31
00:02:36,890 --> 00:02:38,720
Are you kidding me?

32
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:44,550
It's going to be a piece of cake.

33
00:02:44,550 --> 00:02:47,960
You want to bet?

34
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,270
Yeah. What's the bet?

35
00:02:50,270 --> 00:02:54,010
I bet I can go one hour in your class this morning

36
00:02:54,010 --> 00:02:58,060
and not feel a thing!

37
00:02:58,060 --> 00:03:06,170
The bet is -- I win, and you cook dinner for the entire family.

38
00:03:06,170 --> 00:03:10,010
Or you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

39
00:03:10,010 --> 00:03:11,070
It's a bet.

40
00:03:11,070 --> 00:03:15,360
Ok. Call my instructor, Jack Davis, right now.

41
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:19,010
His number is 555-8842.

42
00:03:19,010 --> 00:03:21,060
The advanced class starts at ten o'clock.

43
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:22,000
Well, it's eight twenty now.

44
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:25,750
It only takes eight minutes by bicycle to the aerobics class.

45
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:38,930
Give him a call.

46
00:03:38,930 --> 00:03:41,140
Davis Aerobics Center for Good Health.

47
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:42,180
Jack Davis, please.

48
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:43,250
This is Jack Davis.

49
00:03:43,250 --> 00:03:45,000
Hello. This is Richard Stewart.

50
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,910
My wife, Marilyn Stewart, is a member of your program.

51
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:49,080
I'd like to come to

52
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:51,520
the ten o'clock advanced class this morning.

53
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:54,270
Oh, fine, fine. Be here a few minutes early.

54
00:03:54,270 --> 00:03:57,050
You need to complete some forms before the class.

55
00:03:57,050 --> 00:03:59,140
Thanks. I'm on my way over.

56
00:03:59,140 --> 00:03:59,810
Good-bye.

57
00:03:59,810 --> 00:04:09,230
Bye-bye. It's all set. I'm going.

58
00:04:09,230 --> 00:04:10,260
Bye.

59
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,560
See you later.

60
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,860
Good luck.

61
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:15,610
Don't forget about the bet.

62
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:17,460
Dinner for the entire family.

63
00:04:17,460 --> 00:04:19,350
And that includes Susan.

64
00:04:19,350 --> 00:04:22,350
Don't you forget.
